          <fr:mainmatter>
            <fr:p><fr:em>Abstract:</fr:em> The efficacy of formal verification depends on high quality specifications which are both correct and complete. This talk will ask: What is an ideal specification? How do we evaluate and improve our specifications? And how can Lean help us achieve the highest-assurance software possible?</fr:p>
            <fr:p>Links:</fr:p>
